<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="71184" href="schedule/2018/fall/FAA/499/71184.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2018" href="schedule/2018.xml">2018</calendarYear><term id="120188" href="schedule/2018/fall.xml">Fall 2018</term><subject id="FAA" href="schedule/2018/fall/FAA.xml">Fine and Applied Arts</subject><course id="499" href="schedule/2018/fall/FAA/499.xml">Special Topics</course></parents><sectionNumber>CCP</sectionNumber><sectionTitle>CREATIVE COLLAB-PERFORM ARTS</sectionTitle><creditHours>2 hours</creditHours><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>This course is designed for students seeking a career in the performing arts in a variety of disciplines—performers, composers, designers, directors, and so on.  It will be comprised of attending events at the Krannert Center for the Performing Arts in which the artists are collaborating to create new work.  Classwork will include research about the artists and subject matter, interacting with the artists, and reflecting on the different paradigms available to artists in devising work.</sectionText><partOfTerm>1</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>UNKNOWN</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2018-08-27Z</startDate><endDate>2018-12-12Z</endDate><specialApproval>Instructor Approval Required</specialApproval><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="LCD">Lecture-Discussion</type><start>10:00 AM</start><end>11:30 AM</end><daysOfTheWeek>F      </daysOfTheWeek><roomNumber>4501C</roomNumber><buildingName>Krannert Center for Perf Arts</buildingName><instructors><instructor lastName="Ciofalo" firstName="T">Ciofalo, T</instructor><instructor lastName="Gunn" firstName="J">Gunn, J</instructor><instructor lastName="Pullen" firstName="K">Pullen, K</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>